+++ b/docs/work/2026-07-31-s0-packaged-dispatch/tasks.md
@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+# Tasks
+
+## Task 1 — Add packaged dispatch regression and minimal fix
+- Inspect canonical AGENTS generation/setup and related rules-sync paths.
+- RED: add/update focused test proving packaged/setup AGENTS output lacks or loses the `using-forge` dispatch pointer; run it and capture the expected failure.
+- GREEN: make the smallest implementation/doc-source change in owned files; preserve user content, generated parity, and other harnesses.
+- Run focused generation/onboarding/rules-parity tests and commit the implementation.
